   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 598 of the laws of 1938 relating to incorporating the\nvolunteer and exempt firemen's benevolent association of Briarcliff Manor, New\nYork, and providing for its powers and duties, in relation to precept of\npayment of foreign fire insurance companies",
    "basePrintNo": "S1297",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1297-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
       "districtCode": 40,
       "fullName": "Pete Harckham",
       "imgName": "1053_Pete_Harckham.jpg",
       "incumbent": true,
       "memberId": 1233,
       "sessionMemberId": 1811,
       "sessionYear": 2021,
       "shortName": "HARCKHAM"
      }
     ],
     "size": 1
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§1 & 8, Chap 598 of 1938 (as proposed in S.8531 & A.10313)",
    "lawSection": "Westchester County",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S1297\n\nSPONSOR: REICHLIN-MELNICK\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 598 of the laws of 1938 relating to incorporat-\ning the volunteer and exempt firemen's benevolent association of Briar-\ncliff Manor, New York, and providing for its powers and duties, in\nrelation to precept of payment of foreign fire insurance companies\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis is a chapter amendment that makes changes to provisions of L.2020,\nc.263.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThis legislation amends the underlying chapter to reference updated\ninsurance law sections. The changes are only technical in nature.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nPursuant to approval memo 13 of 2020, the Executive notes that this\namended legislation provides clarity on which insurance law sections are\nbeing referenced in the bill.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nChapter amendment to Chapter 263 of the Laws of 2020.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect on the same date and in the same manner as a\nchapter of the laws of 2020 amending chapter 598 of the laws of 1938\nrelating to changing the form of the benevolent from a corporation to an\nunincorporated association, as proposed in legislative bills numbers\nS.8531 and A.10313, takes effect.\n",
